A document that does not carry the "Editable" label may not be edited, even by an author or editor on its share list with sufficient clearance.

Neither an author nor an editor may edit a document unless the clearance, share list, and label requirements above are all satisfied.

A request by an author to edit a document that meets the clearance, share list, and label requirements must be able to succeed.

