Neither a planner nor a shift supervisor may authorize a switching order that names them as its designated field executor.

Neither an operator nor a control-room operator may execute a switching order that they themselves authorized as its planner.

A run through the workflow by a planner who authorizes a switching order and leaves its field execution to a different operator, tripping none of the prohibitions above, must be able to succeed.

