Neither a pathologist nor an ordering provider may release to the chart a result they verified as the technologist, unless an emergency release has been declared.

A run through the workflow in which a pathologist releases to the chart a result they did not verify and then, with a credential level covering its sensitivity, pushes it to the portal, tripping no prohibition above, must be able to succeed.

